{
  "_": [
    "What each plate was captured at, per plate rather than per run.",
    "A board whose pictures are older than the app is worse than no board, and",
    "nothing else in this repo would ever notice: the plates are gitignored, no",
    "test asserts on them, and a caption written against code that has since",
    "moved still reads perfectly. This file is the only thing that can say so.",
    "",
    "Regenerate a source file's plates with `flutter test <source>`, stamp the",
    "ones it wrote with the commit they were rendered at, then",
    "`python tool/build_screen_board.py --stale` says which plates' descriptions",
    "(test/plates/board.captions.json) to re-read.",
    "",
    "The build 26 board (30 Sep) re-rendered every plate at one commit, so the",
    "shas match; they will not stay that way, which is the point of recording",
    "them per plate. hero_weights is a type study, not a screen, and was not",
    "retaken. Retired with the September board: settings-foot (T2), whose screen",
    "no longer exists."
  ],
